    "golden-capability-gold-plating": {
      "description": "A failed or unavailable authoritative read never concludes the positive premise of a safety gate: admission gates fail closed into a typed defer/deny (the conflict-lane deferred-visibility throw; the topology guard's replica_inventory_unusable denial; the surplus REMOVE commit fence; the ledger quorum-spread confirmation). A hold may fail OPEN on a read gap only where blocking on the gap would itself deadlock convergence, and each fail-open hold names its deadlock witness: the over-target count-keyed create-lane hold (G1; fail-closing it would strand the surplus drain it exists to release) and the routine-direction ledger self-move serialization (a disruptive IDLE_ONLY self-move still fails closed). Advisory probes fail open only where a fail-closed enforcer remains downstream (the provisioning ledger-interlock probe defers to operation creation as the enforcing seam).",
      "owners": [
        "src/rebalancer/replica-status.js"
      ],
      "tests": [
        "test/rebalancer/failed-authoritative-read-admission-verdict.test.js"
      ]
    },
